        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bakermat\n- Music genres: electronic, deep house, tropical house, techno, jazz, soul\n- Songs: \"Vandaag\" (\"One Day (Vandaag)\")\n- Events: Tomorrowland, summer festivals\n\nFacts:\n- Bakermat is a Dutch producer.\n- Bakermat's music mixes electronic music, deep house, tropical house, and techno.\n- Bakermat's music is produced in a minimalist manner with jazz and soul influences.\n- Tropical house artists are often featured at summer festivals such as Tomorrowland.\n- \"Vandaag\" is a song by Bakermat.",
